      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The right house in the right estate. That combination matters.\r\n\r\n21 Glen Alaínn is a three-bedroom semi-detached home in a well-established, family-friendly estate in Mullagh.\r\n\r\nIt’s quiet. It’s practical. And it feels like a proper family home.\r\n\r\nInside, the layout is simple and works. A separate sitting room to the front. A kitchen and dining area to the rear, with access to the garden.\r\nThree bedrooms upstairs, along with the main bathroom.\r\n\r\nNo complicated layout. No wasted space.\r\n\r\nThe house has a strong B energy rating, with pumped walls and attic insulation. There’s also a modern condensing boiler and full-fibre broadband with fast internet speeds.\r\n\r\nThen there’s the location: Mullagh gives you village living and a country feel, without being cut off. The N3 is close by, with the M3 motorway accessible at Kells. Dublin is within straightforward commuting distance. Closer to home, schools, creches, shops and local amenities are all in the village.\r\n\r\nThe Mullagh Biodiversity Walkway is nearby. So are the Cuchulainn’s GAA grounds and Kells and Kingscourt are also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nIt’s a good balance. A quiet village. Country surroundings. And Dublin still within reach.\r\n\r\nThere are houses that sell you on one big feature. This one is about the combination: three bedrooms, strong energy performance, fibre broadband, a family-friendly estate, and Mullagh village on your doorstep.\r\n\r\n21 Glen Alaínn. A home that makes sense.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n– Mains water\r\n– Strong B energy rating\r\n– Pumped walls and attic insulation\r\n– Modern condensing boiler\r\n– Full-fibre broadband with fast internet speeds\r\n– Practical kitchen and dining space\r\n– Private rear garden– Close to schools, creches and local amenities\r\n– Mullagh Biodiversity Walk nearby\r\n– Cuchulainn’s GAA grounds nearby\r\n– N3 and M3 motorway within easy reach\r\n– Mains water and mains sewerage."
      },
